Tool response:
Tool: search_public_recipes
Description: Find public recipes that contain the specified ingredients, sorted by SRM in descending order.
Returns recipe ID, title, description, and SRM value.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "ingredient_names": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "Names of the ingredients to search for (at least one required)",
          "title": "Ingredient Names"
        },
        "sort_by": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Sort field (currently only supports 'srm')",
          "default": "srm",
          "title": "Sort By"
        },
        "sort_order": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Sort direction (asc or desc)",
          "default": "desc",
          "title": "Sort Order"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "ingredient_names"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: add_recipe_to_favorites
Description: Adds a specified recipe to the currently authenticated user's favorites list.
Requires the recipe ID to be provided in the request body.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "recipe_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Recipe Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "recipe_id"
      ]
    }
